      "side": 1,
      "message": "This really doesn\u0027t feel great; effectively there\u0027s listeners with 2 different behaviors, although they\u0027re so similar that I don\u0027t understand why a separate MdnsServiceResolutionListener is necessary.\n\nCould whatever uses MdnsServiceResolutionListener use MdnsServiceBrowserListener instead ?\n\nBetter discuss this directly I think",
